    "result_text": "The change is implemented and all tests pass.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe specification required enqueueing a welcome notification on successful owner create by emitting a line through the logger named `NOTIFY` containing the owner id and the memberId.\n\nI made two edits to `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java`:\n\n1. **Added a `NOTIFY` logger** alongside the existing `AUDIT` logger:\n   ```java\n   private static final Logger NOTIFY = LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"NOTIFY\");\n   ```\n\n2. **Emitted the welcome line** in `addOwner(...)` after the owner is persisted and the audit events are logged (i.e. only on a successful create, past all validation/quota rejections):\n   ```java\n   NOTIFY.info(\"welcome owner id={} memberId={}\", owner.getId(), owner.getMemberId());\n   ```\n\nThe acceptance test `AcceptanceTest.coreEnqueuesWelcome` \u2014 which captures the `NOTIFY` logger and asserts a line contains both the owner id and the `memberId` \u2014 passes, and the full test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 0 failures/errors).",
